The '''Barabesh system''' was a [[star system]]<ref name="The Escape" /> in the [[Mid Rim Territories]] in grid square I-16 of the [[Standard Galactic Grid]].<ref name="Timelines" /> The [[space station]] ''[[Colossus]]'' hid from the [[First Order]] in the system, but its location was discovered when [[Kazuda Xiono]] and [[Jarek Yeager]] attempted to [[Battle of Barabesh|rescue]] [[Tamara Ryvora|Tam Ryvora]] from the First Order. The First Order sent the [[Star Destroyer]] ''[[Thunderer]]'' to attack the ''Colossus'', but the Star Destroyer was ultimately destroyed, and the station was saved.<ref name="The Escape" />

{{System-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The reference book ''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]'', places the Barabesh system is placed in two different regions of the galaxy. According to a map in the book, the Barabesh system is located in the [[Mid Rim Territories]], but another section places it in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Battles">''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]''</ref> This appears to be related to the placement, by the ''[[Star Wars Resistance|Star Wars: Resistance]]'' episode ''[[The Recruit]]'', of [[Castilon]] a ways out in the Outer Rim on the edge of Wild Space and its proximity to Barabesh system in which the [[space station]] [[Colossus]] hid. As the [[2022]] [[Star Wars Galaxy Map (poster)|''Star Wars'' Galaxy Map]] also places it in the Mid Rim, this article assumed it to be the currently correct placement until clarified by [[Lucasfilm]].<ref name="Timelines" />

